  "title": "Scale Python AI Faster with Anyscale on Azure",
  "description": "As Python becomes central to modern AI, many teams struggle to scale from experiments to production. Join this table talk to learn how Anyscale on Azure helps teams move from notebooks to large-scale, distributed AI workloads using open source tools—without managing infrastructure. Discover how managed Ray accelerates training, inference, and data processing, while Azure delivers the security, scale, and reliability needed for enterprise AI.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
